{
    "background_story": "Imran was a young and ambitious professional who had it all - a high-paying job, a luxurious car, and a beautiful apartment. However, as he approached his 30s, he began to feel a sense of emptiness and disconnection from his passions. He felt like he was drifting through life without a clear direction or purpose. One day, while on a solo road trip, Imran stumbled upon a small coastal town where he met a group of free-spirited surfers. Inspired by their carefree lifestyle, he decided to take a break from his corporate job and learn to surf. As he spent more time in the ocean, Imran discovered a sense of calm and clarity that had been missing from his life. He eventually made the bold decision to leave his old life behind and start a new business that combined his love of surfing and environmental sustainability. Imran's journey was a testament to the power of embracing change and allowing oneself to drift towards a more authentic path.",
